<reference id="bacnet-BacnetNumericTrendLogRemoteExt" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Bacnet Numeric Trend Log Remote Ext (bacnet-BacnetNumericTrendLogRemoteExt)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This extension is created dynamically for a remote BACnet device. It creates a history for the StatusNumeric out value of a component using COV or a defined interval.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">BacnetNumericTrendLogRemoteExt</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
            <p class="- topic/p ">You can export the history created by this extension as a fully-compliant BACnet trend log object. </p>
            <note conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnet_datatypeTrendLogExt" class="- topic/note "/>
            <fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">Bacnet Numeric Trend Log Remote Ext properties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" href="../graphic/bacnet_NumericTrendLogRemoteExt_0000065830.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig>
            <p class="- topic/p ">In addition to the common properties (Status, Enabled and Fault Cause), this component has these properties.</p>
